<title>SWITZERLAND: Elektrowatt to keep current dividend pct.</title>
<headline>Elektrowatt to keep current dividend pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss utility Elektrowatt AG, 44 percent owned by Swiss financial group CS Holding, said it wanted to maintain its dividend at the current percentage.</p>
<p>&quot;Our policy is that we want to maintain the dividend percentage. But the board of directors must make the final decision,&quot; chief executive Oskar Runner told a news conference.</p>
</text>
